# ITU-T G.729 official test vectors are large binary files not committed to the repo.
# Download the G.729 Software Package from ITU-T and place files here:
#
#   TEST.IN   - 16-bit linear PCM input speech (16-bit, 8 kHz, mono)
#   TEST.BIT  - Reference encoder bitstream (82 words per frame, little-endian)
#   TEST.pst  - Reference decoder PCM output (post-filtered)
#
# Source: https://www.itu.int/net/itu-t/sigdb/genaudio/audioform-g.aspx?val=10000050
#
# All binary vector files are excluded from version control:
*.bit
*.BIT
*.pcm
*.PCM
*.in
*.IN
*.out
*.OUT
*.pst
*.PST
